+FR-02: sillyhub-daemon/tests/daemon-interactive-bridge.test.ts「duration_api_ms 为 NaN → 不进差分不污染基线（Number.isFinite 门，对齐 total_cost_usd 口径，2026-10-12-duration-nan-guard）」
